  {
    "id": "acad_cal_autumn2026_summary",
    "text": "NIT Delhi Autumn Semester 2026 academic calendar summary: Registration starts 16 Jul 2026 and ends 22 Jul 2026 (late fee window 23-24 Jul). Classes for B.Tech II/III/IV Year, M.Tech II Year and MCA II Year commence on 27 Jul 2026. Mid Semester Examinations run 23 Sep-1 Oct 2026, followed by Mid Semester Break 19-23 Oct 2026. End Semester Examinations run 30 Nov-9 Dec 2026. Last Teaching Day is 25 Nov 2026. Results are declared and the session closes on 17 Dec 2026. Total Teaching Days: 70. Total Working Days: 105. Winter vacation for faculty starts 19 Dec 2026; Spring Semester 2027 registration runs 24-31 Dec 2026, with classes commencing 4 Jan 2027.",
    "metadata": {
      "semester": "Autumn 2026",
      "source": "https://media.nitdelhi.ac.in/uploads/web_media/Academic%20Calendar_Autumn%20Semester%202026@nitdelhi34f6a200-074c-4665-8f2c-bc78e68d4b3b.pdf",
